        <mxCell id="0la0HrTPfz4GJbjPKGwh-31" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="1. Clear cached properties&lt;div&gt;2. Rebuilds all topology-related properties (DoF layout)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;get_global_numbering&lt;/b&gt; -&amp;gt; topology.createSection -&amp;gt; reads topology._dm_renumbering, swarm.getChart&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;get_node_set &lt;/b&gt;-&amp;gt; topology._entity_classes -&amp;gt; new pyop2 set with new sizes for each class&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
